title: Broad left coalition negotiations

This scene must be entered through one of its coalition choices.

@republican
title: <span class="generalitat-coalition" data-parties="erc [+ parlament_current_icv +]" data-summary="Government supported by CUP"><span style="color: var(--erc); font-style: italic;">Republican Government</span></span>
view-if: erc_parlament_s > 0 and parlament_current_icv_s > 0 and cup_parlament_s > 0
choose-if: parlament_republican_available
unavailable-subtitle: [? if parlament_route_cup_broad_block_roadmap: [+ parlament_current_icv +] cannot deal with ERC's current roadmap. ?][? if parlament_route_cup_broad_block_relations: Relations with [+ parlament_current_icv +] are too poor, and we lack the resources to bridge them. ?][? if parlament_route_republican_block_leadership: ERC is not the largest prospective cabinet party. ?][? if parlament_route_republican_block_cup_needed: ERC and [+ parlament_current_icv +] can govern without the CUP's support. ?][? if parlament_route_republican_block_seats: Even with the CUP's support there is no majority to cannot elect this cabinet. ?][? if parlament_route_republican_block_cup_role: The CUP is demanding to enter the cabinet instead of merely supporting it. ?]
on-arrival: {!
    Q.cup_broad_kind = "republican";
!}
go-to: setup

@popular_unity
title: <span class="generalitat-coalition" data-parties="erc [+ parlament_current_icv +] cup" data-summary="Majority government"><span style="color: var(--cup); font-style: italic;">Popular Unity Coalition</span></span>
view-if: erc_parlament_s > 0 and parlament_current_icv_s > 0 and cup_parlament_s > 0
choose-if: parlament_popular_unity_available
unavailable-subtitle: [? if parlament_route_cup_broad_block_roadmap: [+ parlament_current_icv +] cannot deal with ERC's current Roadmap. ?][? if parlament_route_cup_broad_block_relations: Relations with [+ parlament_current_icv +] are too poor and we lack the resources to bridge them. ?][? if parlament_route_popular_unity_block_seats: ERC, [+ parlament_current_icv +], and the CUP do not have a combined majority. ?][? if parlament_route_popular_unity_block_cup_cabinet: The CUP seems willing to support an ERC cabinet, but will not join it. ?]
on-arrival: {!
    Q.cup_broad_kind = "popular_unity";
!}
go-to: setup

@new_popular_front
title: <span class="generalitat-coalition" data-parties="erc psc [+ parlament_current_icv +]" data-summary="Government supported by CUP"><span style="color: var(--erc); font-style: italic;">New Popular Front</span></span>
view-if: erc_parlament_s > 0 and psc_parlament_s > 0 and parlament_current_icv_s > 0 and cup_parlament_s > 0
choose-if: parlament_new_popular_front_available
unavailable-subtitle: [? if erc_roadmap <= 0: ERC has no active independence roadmap on which to base the agreement. ?][? if parlament_route_new_popular_front_block_psc: The current PSC leadership is unwilling to join such an outrageous government agreement. ?][? if parlament_route_new_popular_front_block_leadership: ERC is not leading in seats in the Parlament, so it can hardly propose a leading such coalition. ?][? if parlament_route_new_popular_front_block_cup_needed: The cabinet already has a majority and does not need the CUP's support. ?][? if parlament_route_new_popular_front_block_seats: Even with the CUP's support, this prospective government is lacking a majority. ?][? if parlament_route_new_popular_front_block_cup_role: The CUP would rather enter a smaller cabinet instead of merely supporting this one. ?]
on-arrival: {!
    Q.cup_broad_kind = "new_popular_front";
!}
go-to: setup

@minority_left_tripartite
title: <span class="generalitat-coalition" data-parties="erc psc [+ parlament_current_icv +]" data-summary="Minority government tolerated by CUP"><span style="color: var(--erc); font-style: italic;">Minority Left Tripartite</span></span>
view-if: erc_parlament_s > 0 and psc_parlament_s > 0 and parlament_current_icv_s > 0 and cup_parlament_s > 0
choose-if: parlament_minority_left_tripartite_available
unavailable-subtitle: [? if erc_roadmap <= 0: ERC has no active independence roadmap on which to base the agreement. ?][? if parlament_route_minority_left_block_psc: The current PSC leadership is unwilling to join such an outrageous government agreement. ?][? if parlament_route_minority_left_block_leadership: ERC is not leading in seats in the Parlament, so it can hardly propose a leading such coalition. ?][? if parlament_route_minority_left_block_cup_needed: The cabinet already has a majority and does not need the CUP's abstention. ?][? if parlament_route_minority_left_block_seats: Even a CUP abstention is insufficient to elect this cabinet. ?][? if parlament_route_minority_left_block_cup_role: The CUP would rather enter a smaller cabinet instead of merely abstaining. ?]
on-arrival: {!
    Q.cup_broad_kind = "minority_left_tripartite";
!}
go-to: setup

@setup
on-arrival: {!
    Q.cup_broad_coalition_phase = 1;
    Q.parlament_coalition_push = 0;
    Q.parlament_coalition_cabinet_seats = Q.erc_parlament_s + Q.parlament_current_icv_s;
    if (Q.cup_broad_kind == "new_popular_front" || Q.cup_broad_kind == "minority_left_tripartite") {
        Q.parlament_coalition_cabinet_seats += Q.psc_parlament_s;
    }
    if (Q.cup_broad_kind == "popular_unity") {
        Q.parlament_coalition_cabinet_seats += Q.cup_parlament_s;
    }
    Q.parlament_coalition_support_seats = Q.parlament_coalition_cabinet_seats + ((Q.cup_broad_kind == "republican" || Q.cup_broad_kind == "new_popular_front") ? Q.cup_parlament_s : 0);
    Q.parlament_coalition_leader = "erc";
    if (Q.cup_broad_kind == "popular_unity" && Q.parlament_current_icv_s > Q.erc_parlament_s && Q.parlament_current_icv_s > Q.cup_parlament_s) {
        Q.parlament_coalition_leader = Q.parlament_current_icv;
    }
    if (Q.cup_broad_kind == "popular_unity" && Q.cup_parlament_s > Q.erc_parlament_s && Q.cup_parlament_s >= Q.parlament_current_icv_s) {
        Q.parlament_coalition_leader = "cup";
    }
    // The cabinet leader normally nominates the largest junior cabinet partner.
    Q.speaker_party = Q.parlament_current_icv;
    if (Q.cup_broad_kind == "new_popular_front" || Q.cup_broad_kind == "minority_left_tripartite") {
        Q.speaker_party = Q.psc_parlament_s >= Q.parlament_current_icv_s ? "psc" : Q.parlament_current_icv;
    }
    if (Q.cup_broad_kind == "popular_unity") {
        if (Q.parlament_coalition_leader == "erc") {
            Q.speaker_party = Q.parlament_current_icv_s >= Q.cup_parlament_s ? Q.parlament_current_icv : "cup";
        }
        if (Q.parlament_coalition_leader == Q.parlament_current_icv) {
            Q.speaker_party = Q.erc_parlament_s >= Q.cup_parlament_s ? "erc" : "cup";
        }
        if (Q.parlament_coalition_leader == "cup") {
            Q.speaker_party = Q.erc_parlament_s >= Q.parlament_current_icv_s ? "erc" : Q.parlament_current_icv;
        }
    }
    if (Q.speaker_party == "erc") {
        Q.speaker = Q.year < 2016 ? "Anna Simó" : "Roger Torrent";
        Q.speaker_gender = Q.year < 2016 ? "f" : "m";
    } else if (Q.speaker_party == "psc") {
        Q.speaker = "Xabier Sabaté";
        Q.speaker_gender = "m";
    } else if (Q.speaker_party == "cup") {
        Q.speaker = Q.year < 2017 ? "Julià de Jòdar" : "Vidal Aragonés";
        Q.speaker_gender = "m";
    } else {
        Q.speaker = Q.parlament_current_icv_leader == "Lluís Rabell" ? "Dolors Camats" : "Lluís Rabell";
        Q.speaker_gender = Q.parlament_current_icv_leader == "Lluís Rabell" ? "f" : "m";
    }
!}

Before cabinet negotiations begin, the prospective partners must settle the Speakership. [? if player_party = "cup" and cup_broad_kind != "popular_unity": The prospective cabinet has nominated [+ speaker +] ([+ speaker_party +]). Since CUP remains outside the cabinet, we may accept that nominee or demand the office as part of our [? if cup_broad_kind = "minority_left_tripartite": abstention?][? if cup_broad_kind != "minority_left_tripartite": support?] agreement.?][? if player_party = "cup" and cup_broad_kind = "popular_unity" and parlament_coalition_leader != "cup": The leading party has nominated [+ speaker +] ([+ speaker_party +]). We may accept its proposal or demand the office for CUP.?][? if player_party = "cup" and cup_broad_kind = "popular_unity" and parlament_coalition_leader = "cup": As the leading party, we are expected to nominate the largest junior partner, [+ speaker_party +]. Retaining the office for CUP would reduce our leverage in the cabinet negotiations.?][? if player_party = "erc" and parlament_coalition_leader = "erc": As the leading party, we are expected to nominate the largest junior partner, [+ speaker_party +]. Retaining the office for ERC would reduce our leverage in the cabinet negotiations.?][? if player_party = "erc" and parlament_coalition_leader != "erc": The leading party has nominated [+ speaker +] ([+ speaker_party +]). We may accept its proposal or demand the office for ERC.?]

- @accept_nominee
- @player_speaker

@accept_nominee
title: [? if player_party = "cup" and cup_broad_kind != "popular_unity": Accept the cabinet's nominee?][? if player_party = "cup" and cup_broad_kind = "popular_unity" and parlament_coalition_leader != "cup": Accept the leader's proposal?][? if player_party = "cup" and cup_broad_kind = "popular_unity" and parlament_coalition_leader = "cup": Nominate [+ speaker_party +] for Speaker?][? if player_party = "erc" and parlament_coalition_leader = "erc": Nominate [+ speaker_party +] for Speaker?][? if player_party = "erc" and parlament_coalition_leader != "erc": Accept the leader's proposal?]
go-to: parlament_coalition_cup_broad_phase

@player_speaker
title: [? if player_party = "cup" and cup_broad_kind != "popular_unity": Demand the Speaker for CUP?][? if player_party = "cup" and cup_broad_kind = "popular_unity" and parlament_coalition_leader = "cup": Retain the Speaker for CUP?][? if player_party = "cup" and cup_broad_kind = "popular_unity" and parlament_coalition_leader != "cup": Demand the Speaker for CUP?][? if player_party = "erc" and parlament_coalition_leader = "erc": Retain the Speaker for ERC?][? if player_party = "erc" and parlament_coalition_leader != "erc": Demand the Speaker for ERC?]
view-if: speaker_party != player_party
on-arrival: {!
    Q.speaker_party = Q.player_party;
    if (Q.player_party == "cup") {
        Q.speaker = Q.year < 2017 ? "Julià de Jòdar" : "Vidal Aragonés";
        Q.speaker_gender = "m";
    } else {
        Q.speaker = Q.year < 2016 ? "Anna Simó" : "Roger Torrent";
        Q.speaker_gender = Q.year < 2016 ? "f" : "m";
    }
!}
go-to: parlament_coalition_cup_broad_phase
